\begin_layout Standard
Table 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "tab:rankings"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"

\end_inset

 summarizes the Friedman-based ranking of all eight optimizers across the 97 (problem,
 dimension) instances,
 together with the number of instances each method won outright and its mean success rate.
 The compression-based (
\emph on
sparq
\emph default
) and eigenvector-guided (
\emph on
ea4eig
\emph default
) DE-lineage methods dominate both the rank sum and the win count,
 but neither approaches an overwhelming majority of wins,
 indicating that the underlying algorithm-selection problem is non-trivial.
\end_layout

